==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Selena]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 86.67~93.33 seconds<sup>2,600f~2,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] to deal extremely high damage to Selena. Rushers such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] can help with money management, while you spam [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cats]] to deal with the Angel enemies.

[[Talents|Talented]] [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]] can be used as a much faster alternative to Pizza Cat if you're looking for a quicker win, since neither outrange Selena either way. [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] should be used for crowned versions to stunlock Selena when enemy magnifications become too much to handle.

